OL,3,GNEWSA'Mum and Dad are still missing
OL,4,Aafter the flooding in the Himalayas'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrajval Haldia has has not heard from
OL,7,Fhis parents, Pavan and Kavita, since
OL,8,Fthe devastating floods in the Himalayas
OL,9,Ftwo weeks ago.
OL,11,FThe last he heard they were enjoying
OL,12,Ftheir trip to the mountain range, and
OL,13,Fwere last known to be at Gyirong Port,
OL,14,Fon the Tibet-Nepal border, on the way
OL,15,Fto Mount Kailash with a tour group.
OL,17,FSince the devastating floods surged
OL,18,Fthrough the area on 26 August, messages
OL,19,Ffrom both have stopped, and Prajval has
OL,20,Fnot heard anything of their whereabouts
OL,21,Fsince.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
