OL,3,GNEWSA'Mum and Dad are still missing
OL,4,Aafter the flooding in the Himalayas'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think it gets harder to stay
OL,7,Fpositive day by day but we're just
OL,8,Ftrying to keep hope. Maybe no news is
OL,9,Fgood news," said Prajval, who is from
OL,10,FPetts Wood in south-east London.
